<div class="pos-client-search"><label for="pos-client-search">Buscar cliente</label><div class="pos-search-row"><input id="pos-client-search" type="search" maxlength="100" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Nombre o DNI…" data-pos-client-search aria-controls="pos-client-results" aria-expanded="false"><button type="button" data-pos-client-now aria-label="Buscar clientes"><x-icon name="users"/></button></div><div id="pos-client-results" class="pos-client-results" data-pos-client-results></div><p class="pos-client-status" data-pos-client-status aria-live="polite">Venta sin cliente. Selecciona uno para consultar fidelidad y saldo.</p></div>
<div class="pos-client-card" data-pos-client-card hidden><div class="pos-client-heading"><span class="avatar"><x-icon name="users"/></span><div><strong data-client-name></strong><small data-client-document></small></div><button type="button" data-pos-clear-client aria-label="Quitar cliente">×</button></div><div class="pos-client-stats"><span>Ventas completadas<strong data-client-sales></strong></span><span>Saldo disponible<strong data-client-credit></strong></span></div><div class="loyalty-card"><div class="loyalty-heading"><strong>★ Tarjeta de fidelidad</strong><span data-client-stamps></span></div><div class="loyalty-stars" data-loyalty-stars aria-label="Sellos acumulados"></div><p data-loyalty-message></p></div></div>
